{"ID":"20240118151015-ttmh4d6","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151015-ttmh4d6","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151015-ttmh4d6\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151015-ui79gsj\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122152728-ryv1q77\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122152728-ryv1q77\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:59,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:59\u0026#125;","title":"284青葙子（草决明）","type":"doc","updated":"20240204100029"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151015-ui79gsj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151015-ui79gsj","updated":"20240122152648"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味苦，微寒，无毒。治邪气，皮肤中热，风瘙身痒，杀三虫，子，名草决明，治唇口青，生平谷道旁。一名草蒿，一名萎蒿。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122152651-ye0syu6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122152651-ye0syu6"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】产我国南方暖地田野，为草本植物，茎直立，叶作披针形，花作淡红色，茎叶皆入药，名草决明，子名青葙子，别有一种名决明子，与此名似而物殊。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122152653-vlprv3g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122152653-vlprv3g"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味苦，性微寒，无毒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122152655-gw10jdv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122152655-gw10jdv"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】青葙子为眼科要药，主镇肝明目，治赤障青盲翳膜。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122152657-b0i9ib4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122152657-b0i9ib4"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【甄权】治肝脏热毒充眼，赤障青盲翳肿，恶疮疥疮。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122152658-nzwglxa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122152658-nzwglxa"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【大明】治五脏邪气，益脑髓，镇肝，明耳目，坚筋骨，去风寒湿痹。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122152700-a8wm81d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122152700-a8wm81d"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】普通一钱至二、三钱。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122152701-k9b7jr6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122152701-k9b7jr6"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】虚寒之人，火衰目病者不宜。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122152649-5jdwiek","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122152649-5jdwiek"}},{"ID":"20240122152702-v1wl5pr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122152702-v1wl5pr"}},{"ID":"20240122152702-pbeb8rx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122152702-pbeb8rx","updated":"20240204095657"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"284，青葙子，它又名草决明，诸位读过决明子，草决明跟决明子很类似。这个呢，味苦，性微寒。"}]},{"ID":"20240122152712-9zep1o4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122152712-9zep1o4","updated":"20240204095806"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"诸位看看这个青葙子长这样子。处方的时候也是两钱、三钱，都可以使用，这个"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"青葙子是治疗眼科的，和决明子一样，眼科的药。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122152719-5eywdaw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122152719-5eywdaw","updated":"20240204095825"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"诸位，如果你说我什么都不要看，我就专门看眼科，你从这边开始往回头，把眼科的药物通通找出来分寒热，然后在放到柴胡汤，小柴胡汤里面，几乎眼科的病都治，很快，很简单，因为我讲过，你只要有经方做基础，基础方由经方做导使，把药物带到那个位置上，再加药进去就好了，这是最好的方子。"}]},{"ID":"20240122152722-sk4n5ln","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122152722-sk4n5ln","updated":"20240204095832"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"味苦，性微寒，无毒，他是正肝明目的，治疗赤障，青盲，眼翳膜，各类的翳膜都可以"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，因为他能把这个热度清掉，他是寒性的药，那个治肝脏热毒，肝开窍在眼睛，所以我们眼睛的问题，眼翳的问题，我们通通使用，在肝经上面来判断。"}]},{"ID":"20240122152728-ryv1q77","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122152728-ryv1q77","updated":"20240204100029"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"决明子呢很好吃，你炒熟以后，麦一样，当茶喝，炒决明子是放在汤剂里面使用的，你平时泡炒决明子很难吃啊，决明子很好吃，决明子真的特像麦茶一样，在放点蔗糖更好。今天介绍到这里，我们休息。这个是青葙子，这个青葙子呢就是上次介绍的草决明，我们用那个石决明，是眼科的要药。"}]}]}